<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT - Singapore office sector peaked - Barings.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Singapore office sector peaked - Barings.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings Securities said the Singapore office sector has peaked and has recommended investors &quot;underweight&quot; the property sector in their portfolios.</p>
<p>In its latest report dated September 11, Barings recommended a sell on Singapore Land (SingLand) and United Industrial Corp (UIC). It said Straits Steamship Land Ltd (SSL) and DBS Land were fully valued. City Developments Ltd (CityDev) is a core holding and United Overseas Land (UOL) a buy, Barings said.</p>
</text>
